  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "塩味と　苦味が　強い　食材。燻製による　独特の風味が　ある。特に　野菜類との　相性が　よい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "짠맛과 쓴맛이 강한 식재료. 훈제 특유의 독특한 풍미가 난다. 특히 채소 종류와 궁합이 잘 맞는다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "鹹味和苦味強勁的食材。帶有煙燻過後的獨特風味。和蔬菜類特別搭配。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrédient au goût très salé et amer. C’est grâce à un processus de fumaison qu’on obtient ce goût unique qui s’accorde si bien avec les légumes.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Der Räuchervorgang verleiht dieser sehr salzigen sowie bitteren Zutat ein charakteristisches Aroma. Sie passt hervorragend zu allerlei Gemüsesorten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El ahumado aporta un aroma especial a este ingrediente ya de por sí muy salado y amargo. Casa muy bien con todo tipo de verduras.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Un ingrediente molto salato e amaro. L’affumicatura gli conferisce un sapore caratteristico che si abbina bene in particolare con le verdure.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A very salty and bitter ingredient with that unmistakable smoky flavor. It pairs exceptionally well with veggies.",
